Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:48:15 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 41/55] Sync the liveness engine: F15 identity binding

Engine jars from Mosip26 f44506d (f15-identity-binding: "F15: identity
binding in the engine, and the threshold rule in BindingEvaluation").
- FaceMatcher.identify compares a live face with onboarded face
  templates: the best of several, with the same detection and alignment
  as F1.
- The identity threshold has its own key,
  mosip.registration.liveness.face.binding.identity.threshold (default
  0.40).
The models and CameraXFrameSource.java are unchanged (same SHA-256).

Tested together with the next commit, which uses it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
